OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785714477
OL,3,CRelax rules for motorists who pass
OL,4,Cautomatic tests ` AA
OL,6,FMotorists who pass automatic driving
OL,7,Ftests should be allowed behind the
OL,8,Fwheel of a manual car after completing
OL,9,Fa one-hour conversion session,
OL,10,Faccording to the AA.
OL,12,FEdmund King, president of the motoring
OL,13,Fservices company, told the Press
OL,14,FAssociation "it doesn't make sense"
OL,15,Ffor them to wait months for a manual
OL,16,Fdriving test slot, as most "quickly
OL,17,Fdevelop good road skills".
OL,19,FMotorists who pass the test in an
OL,20,Fautomatic car are currently only
OL,21,Fpermitted to drive automatics.
OL,26,@vD@MOUvD@cO]xD@\OUyD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
