FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785714477
OL,3,CRelax rules for motorists who pass
OL,4,Cautomatic tests ` AA
OL,6,FIf they later want to drive a manual
OL,7,Fcar ` such as when working, hiring a
OL,8,Fcar or borrowing a friend or
OL,9,Frelative's car ` they must pass a
OL,10,Ffurther test in a manual car.
OL,12,FBut Driver and Vehicle Standards
OL,13,FAgency (DVSA) figures show the average
OL,14,Fwaiting time to book a test in May was
OL,15,Fnearly 22 weeks, compared with about
OL,16,Ffive weeks in February 2020 before the
OL,17,Fcoronavirus pandemic.
OL,19,FThe proportion of learners taking
OL,20,Fautomatic driving tests in Britain is
OL,21,Fat a record high.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785714477
OL,3,CRelax rules for motorists who pass
OL,4,Cautomatic tests ` AA
OL,6,FDVSA data shows 29.4% of all tests
OL,7,Fconducted in the last financial year
OL,8,Fwere in an automatic car, up from
OL,9,Fabout 4% in 2007/08.
OL,11,FElectric cars, which have surged in
OL,12,Fpopularity in recent years, do not
OL,13,Fhave a conventional gearbox, meaning
OL,14,Fpeople who choose to learn in them
OL,15,Ftake automatic tests.
OL,17,FWhereas a manual car has a gear system
OL,18,Foperated by moving the gear stick and
OL,19,Fclutch pedal, automatics change gears
OL,20,Fbased on speed, without the driver
OL,21,Fdoing anything.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785714477
OL,3,CRelax rules for motorists who pass
OL,4,Cautomatic tests ` AA
OL,6,FThis means automatic cars are
OL,7,Fgenerally considered easier to drive,
OL,8,Fbut they can be more expensive, and
OL,9,Fsome people find them less interesting.
OL,11,FMr King said many new drivers go
OL,12,Fautomatic as they want to "ditch the
OL,13,Fclutch, gear stick and difficult hill
OL,14,Fstarts".
OL,16,FHe went on: "Most drivers of automatic
OL,17,Fcars quickly develop good road skills,
OL,18,Fso it doesn't make sense to force them
OL,19,Fto spend months overcoming the driving
OL,20,Ftest backlog just to borrow a manual
OL,21,Fcar.
OL,26,@tD@[OUvD@GO]xD@MOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785714477
OL,3,CRelax rules for motorists who pass
OL,4,Cautomatic tests ` AA
OL,6,F"What we need is the Government to
OL,7,Fapprove a conversion lesson provided
OL,8,Fby driving schools so that those that
OL,9,Fpass their test in an automatic can
OL,10,Falso drive manual vehicles legally.
OL,12,F"Such a one-hour conversion course
OL,13,Fwould help those who may occasionally
OL,14,Fneed to drive a manual car do so
OL,15,Flegally.
OL,17,F"This would be more pragmatic that
OL,18,Fretesting them in a manual vehicle
OL,19,Fwhen the DVSA is struggling to get rid
OL,20,Fof the current test backlog."
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUyD@AOU|D@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785714477
OL,3,CRelax rules for motorists who pass
OL,4,Cautomatic tests ` AA
OL,6,FA Department for Transport
OL,7,Fspokesperson said: "For the safety of
OL,8,Fall road users, anyone wishing to
OL,9,Fdrive a manual car must pass a manual
OL,10,Fdriving test, and we have no plans to
OL,11,Fchange this."
OL,13,FMeasures taken to tackle the backlog
OL,14,Fof driving tests include recruiting
OL,15,Fmore examiners and training them
OL,16,Ffaster, using military examiners and
OL,17,Freforming the booking process to
OL,18,Fcombat misuse.
OL,26,@oD@TOUsD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/6
